  "sourceDescription": "The brilliant song Detour Ahead as recorded by Kurt Elling with original arrangement by Laurence Hopgood.\r\nThis is an adaption of Hopgood's arrangement for three horns, so this now includes four horn (trumpet, alto, tenor and baritone saxes).\r\nFor intermediate to advanced players as the harmonies are expanded and time changes over the course of the song.\r\nOnly (so far) with rudimentary piano and drum parts.\r\n\r\nSuggestions for improvements are more than welcome!",
